### ===== AUTH =====
# Copia el token que devuelve /auth/login en la variable de abajo (dura 15 minutos)
@token = PEGAR_TOKEN_AQUI

### Registrar usuario
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/registro HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "username": "admin",
    "password": "admin123"
}

### Login (devuelve el token)
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "username": "admin",
    "password": "admin123"
}


### ===== CATEGORIA =====

### Listar categorias
GET http://localhost:8080/categoria HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Obtener categoria por id
GET http://localhost:8080/categoria/1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear categoria
POST http://localhost:8080/categoria HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
content-type: application/json

{
    "nombreCategoria": "SUV"
}

### Actualizar categoria
PUT http://localhost:8080/categoria/1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
content-type: application/json

{
    "nombreCategoria": "Sedan"
}

### Eliminar categoria
DELETE http://localhost:8080/categoria/1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ===== VEHICULO =====

### Listar vehiculos
GET http://localhost:8080/vehiculo HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Obtener vehiculo por id
GET http://localhost:8080/vehiculo/1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear vehiculo
POST http://localhost:8080/vehiculo HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
content-type: application/json

{
    "marca": "Toyota",
    "color": "Rojo",
    "categoria": { "idCategoria": 1 }
}

### Actualizar vehiculo
PUT http://localhost:8080/vehiculo/1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
content-type: application/json

{
    "marca": "Toyota",
    "color": "Azul",
    "categoria": { "idCategoria": 1 }
}

### Eliminar vehiculo
DELETE http://localhost:8080/vehiculo/1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
